%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Haldrik_Missions_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 100000000000
    m_Localized: "This place isn\u2019t bad\u2026 stone walls, a half-intact roof\u2026
      and I only hear screams at night sometimes. Yes, it works as a forge."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 200000000000
    m_Localized: "We\u2019ve already\u2026 I\u2019ve set up something like a smithy
      here. The fire holds, the anvil holds, and so do we. More or less."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 300000000000
    m_Localized: If you manage to survive out there, maybe I can improve your weapons.
      No one should face the mist with mediocre iron.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 400000000000
    m_Localized: "By the way... Before arriving I left a weapon hilt in the Fields
      of Penitence. A masterpiece, by the way. Well\u2026 almost. Bring it to me
      and I\u2019ll show you what good hands can craft."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 500000000000
    m_Localized: "A good weapon needs balance\u2026 and that hilt had perfect balance.
      Well, almost perfect. Tharims left one side longer. I mean\u2026 I did. I left
      it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 600000000000
    m_Localized: "Still haven\u2019t found it? Search among the ruins of the Fields
      of Penitence. If the consumed haven\u2019t used it to hit each other, it should
      still be there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 700000000000
    m_Localized: "Look at that! I knew it was still intact\u2026 more or less. Give
      it to me before it rusts for another century."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 800000000000
    m_Localized: "Good work. With this I can make real weapons again. Well\u2026
      dangerous weapons for your enemies, I mean."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 900000000000
    m_Localized: "Give me a moment\u2026 metal needs heat, patience and stop touching
      that! \u2026Almost done."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1000000000000
    m_Localized: "I tried forging armor from old scraps\u2026 now it protects very
      well\u2026 the rats. Not ideal."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1100000000000
    m_Localized: I need real iron. In the desert veins there are still good minerals,
      buried under that treacherous sand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1200000000000
    m_Localized: "Bring me 8 pieces of iron and I\u2019ll make you a piece of armor.
      Well made, sturdy\u2026 and only a little dangerous for anyone who isn\u2019t
      you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1300000000000
    m_Localized: Nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1400000000000
    m_Localized: "Still alive out there? Good. The desert doesn\u2019t usually return
      things intact."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1500000000000
    m_Localized: "8 pieces of iron. Not one less. If you come back with sand, I\u2019ll
      make you sand armor. Not useful, but symbolic."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1600000000000
    m_Localized: "Perfect\u2026 this is exactly what I needed. Give me a second and
      I\u2019ll forge it. If you see sparks flying, that\u2019s a good sign\u2026
      I think."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1700000000000
    m_Localized: Nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1800000000000
    m_Localized: Nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1900000000000
    m_Localized: "Alright\u2026 this is simple. I just need a gem. A good one. Nothing
      strange. Nothing\u2026 alive. Preferably."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2000000000000
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t ask what it\u2019s for. It\u2019s for the forge. Yes.
      That. The forge. Not my\u2026 well, the forge."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2100000000000
    m_Localized: Bring me a decent gem from the desert. From the camp of the consumed...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2200000000000
    m_Localized: Nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300000000000
    m_Localized: "If you already have it, don\u2019t look at it too much. Good gems\u2026
      look back at you. It\u2019s a theory."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2400000000000
    m_Localized: "How are the consumed doing? They don\u2019t seem very talkative."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2500000000000
    m_Localized: Nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2600000000000
    m_Localized: Nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2700000000000
    m_Localized: "Perfect\u2026 yes, that will do. Don\u2019t get too close while
      I place it in the forge\u2026 or whatever this is now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2800000000000
    m_Localized: "Give me a moment\u2026 this will need heat, metal and\u2026 well,
      a lot of improvisation. It\u2019ll come out as a full armor. Probably a good
      one."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2900000000000
    m_Localized: Nothing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3000000000000
    m_Localized: "The metal improves\u2026 but so must you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3100000000000
    m_Localized: Forty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3200000000000
    m_Localized: "If you're going to wield what I make\u2026 prove you can use it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3300000000000
    m_Localized: "\u2026Go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3400000000000
    m_Localized: Forty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3500000000000
    m_Localized: That's what I asked for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3600000000000
    m_Localized: How many so far?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3700000000000
    m_Localized: Don't stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3800000000000
    m_Localized: The steel is ready. You're not.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3900000000000
    m_Localized: Come back when you're done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4000000000000
    m_Localized: "\u2026Done."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4100000000000
    m_Localized: Feels different now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4200000000000
    m_Localized: "The iron\u2026 and you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4600000000000
    m_Localized: The fire speaks. You don't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4700000000000
    m_Localized: I have work to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4800000000000
    m_Localized: What do you want?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4900000000000
    m_Localized: The hammer doesn't rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5000000000000
    m_Localized: "\u2026Yes. What."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5600000000000
    m_Localized: Good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5700000000000
    m_Localized: "\u2026Yes. Go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5800000000000
    m_Localized: The fire keeps burning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14582977602842624
    m_Localized: Upgrade Weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4300000000000
    m_Localized: Oh! Hello. Greetings. Welcome. One of the previous three.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4400000000000
    m_Localized: In what can I... we... what can I help you with?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4500000000000
    m_Localized: The blacksmith is available. It's me. The blacksmith.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5100000000000
    m_Localized: Hey, we had... I had an idea. For a commission. If you're not busy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5200000000000
    m_Localized: We need to ask you something. I! I need to ask you something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5300000000000
    m_Localized: You haven't come back with everything yet! I mean... I'm waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5400000000000
    m_Localized: How is it going? I'm asking out of politeness. And because we're
      expectant. I.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5500000000000
    m_Localized: Take your time. Although if you can go faster, better for everyone...
      for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16045431673032704
    m_Localized: Talk to Haldrik to complete the quest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12184221653725184
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t come any closer! Ah\u2026 no. You\u2019re not one of
      them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12184367854579712
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m Haldrik. Still in one piece\u2026 more or less."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12184507139026944
    m_Localized: "We hid here to avoid going back to the furnaces of Thararel\u2026
      it was the only way to stay alive."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12184625334513664
    m_Localized: Thanks for getting me out of this hole.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16374422064132096
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ll head to the village, if my legs still obey me\u2026 and
      there, maybe, I can repay you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
